WEBVTT

00:04:58.250 --> 00:05:00.268
"businesses will purchase less of it.

00:05:00.292 --> 00:05:02.809
Thousands of low-wage workers
will lose their jobs.

00:05:02.833 --> 00:05:04.726
The restaurants will close."

00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:06.000
Except ...

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:08.250
they didn't.

00:05:08.917 --> 00:05:12.125
The unemployment rate fell dramatically.

00:05:13.125 --> 00:05:16.018
The restaurant business in Seattle boomed.

00:05:16.042 --> 00:05:17.292
Why?

00:05:18.083 --> 00:05:20.500
Because there is no equilibrium.

00:05:21.917 --> 00:05:24.726
Because raising wages
doesn't kill jobs, it creates them;

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:26.226
because, for instance,

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:31.143
when restaurant owners are suddenly
required to pay restaurant workers enough